  "label": "Racialized Gender Violence Trope",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Black men are inherently more likely to be abusive partners, while White men are inherently non-abusive. This trope is a form of racialized gender violence that falsely generalizes the behavior of entire racial groups based on the actions of a few individuals, perpetuating systemic racism and misogyny.",
